        "271",
        "105302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877816cc16ab04bd48ce0dd3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "里面有满~~满的我喜欢的东西哦！\\n　　　　　　　　　　　微光飞驹留！\\n\\nP.S.下次再玩胡萝卜超人角色扮演吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "398720723e43b0b4759fa27795c9aaae6232bc6df4bd88a1951df751b3ff7d94",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "271",
        "105401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe6bdbd36af8e7b926c3111",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Marvelous。窗外照进第一缕阳光。\\n露水沾湿牵牛花。铁路道口栏杆降。\\n旧天桥。围栏绕。黑板在闪耀。\\n朋友在欢笑。情人节。2点22分。\\n海玻璃。训练员。想看你的笑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4df2df092e654dacc77e7a85d1a575742e0f5747a53e5280366593ad98ba38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
